hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
1524,"# Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\n**Muhammad ibn 'Ubayd al-Muharibi al-Kufi ne humein riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha:** Sharik ne humein riwayat ki, Abu al-Hasna' se, al-Hakam se, Hanish se, aur Sayyiduna Ali رضي الله عنه se, ke woh do menhdiyan qurbaan karte the (udhiyah): ek Nabi ﷺ ki taraf se aur doosri apni taraf se. Jab un se is bare mein pucha gaya, to unhone farmaya: **\Unhon ne mujhe is ka hukm diya\""** — yani Nabi ﷺ ne — **\""aur main is kabhi tark nahi karunga.\""**\n\nAbu 'Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: **\""Yeh ek gharib (nadira) Hadith hai. Hum ise Sharik ki riwayat ke siwa nahi jaante.\""**\n\nUnhon ne yeh bhi farmaya: **\""Ulema-e-Hadith mein se baaz logon ne murde ke liye qurbaan ki ibahat rakhi hai"," jabke doosre ne iska mana kiya hai.\""**\n\n'Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne farmaya: **\""Mujh se ziyada mahboob hai ke murde ke liye sadaqa diya jaye bajaye qurbaan ki. Lekin agar koi qurbaan kare"," to us mein se kuch na khaye aur sab kuch sadaqa kar de.\""**\n\nMuhammad (al-Bukhari) ne farmaya: Ali ibn al-Madini ne kaha: **\""Yeh Hadith Sharik ke siwa doosre rawiyon se bhi marwi hai.\""**\n\nMain ne un se pucha: **\""Abu al-Hasna' ka kya naam hai?\""** Unhe maloom nahi tha. Muslim ne farmaya: **\""Unka naam al-Hasan hai.\""**\n\n---\n\n*Yeh riwayat Sunan al-Tirmidhi mein darj hai aur is se mutalliq hai ke Nabi ﷺ ke wafat ke baad un ki taraf se qurbaan ki ja sakti ya nahi"," is mas'ale par ikhtilaf-e-ulema hai.*"""
1525,"Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \myn nby krym (ﷺ) kay sath ayd alazhyٰ kay dn msly (nmaz ayd ky jgh) pr hazr tha۔ jb aap (ﷺ) nay apny khtbh mkml frmaya...\"""""
1526,Al-Bara' ibn 'Azib (RaziAllahu Anhu) rivayet karte hain ki Rasoolullah (SallAllahu Alayhi Wa Sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Koi aisa janwar, jisana uski langalan (limp) zaahir ho, kurban na karein; aur koi aisa andhi janwar, jisaki andhilapan zaahir ho, kurban na karein; aur koi aisa bimaar janwar, jisaki bimaari zaahir ho, kurban na karein; aur koi aisa dhoopela (emaciated) janwar, jisaki haddiyon mein marrow na ho," kurban na karein.\"""""
1527,"Yeh hadees ka matlab hai ke naye paida hone wale bachay ko naam rakha jaye aur us ka sar mundwana kiya jaye. \nJam e Tirmazi, Hadees: 1522 (Arabic Hadees: 1522)"
1528,"Umm Salamah (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne Dhul-Hijjah ke chaand dekh liya...\"""""
1529,"Hazrat Aishah (Razi Allahu Anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Nafarmani (na-farmani) par mannat (qasam) nahi hoti.\"""""
1530,"Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah ki nafarmani mein koi nazar (mannat) nahi hoti.\"""""
1531,"Thabit bin Adh-Dahhak (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat karte hain ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Kisi shakhs ke liye yeh jaaiz nahi ke woh aisi cheez par nazar (qasam) kare jis par uska ikhtiyaar (control) na ho.\"""""
1532,"Uqbah bin Amir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jb ksy qsm ky kfart myn kwyy mkhsws zkr nh hw tw as ky kfart qsm ky kfart hay۔\"""""
1533,"Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nAbdur-Rahman bin Samurah (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aey Abdur-Rahman! Tum mat maango imamat (leadership ki haisiyat) ko.\"""""
1534,"Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) kay rwayt krdh hdys:\n\nnby akrm (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qsm khayay...\"""""
1535,"Hazrat Ibn 'Umar (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qsm khayay awr as myn khh kr an shaa allh shaml kr lay۔\"""""
1536,"Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs qsm khayay awr khay: 'an shaa allh' (agr allh nay chaha)"""
1537,**Salim ne apne walid Hazrat Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne suna ke Hazrat Umar (رضي الله
1538,Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) Umar (رضي الله عنہ) se milay jab woh apni sawari par baithey thay.
1539,Sa'd bin Ubaidah ne riwayat ki ke Ibn Umar (raz.) ne ek shakhs ko yeh kehte hue suna: \Nahi," Ka'bah ki kasam!\"" Tab Ibn Umar (raz.) ne kaha: \""Allah ke siwa kisi ki kasam nahi di jaati.\"""""
1540,# Hadith ka Tarjama\n\n**Bara' ibn 'Aziz (razAllahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya:**\n\nUnhon ne farmaya: \Rasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne humein Qurbani ke din (Yawm al-Nahr) mein khutba diya aur farmaya: **'Tum mein se koi bhi us namaz ada karne se pehle qurbani na kare.'**\n\nMere mamoon (maternal uncle) khade hote hue kaha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool, yeh woh din hai jis mein gosht mushkil se milta hai, aur maine apne gharalon, apne ahl-e-bayt ya apne qaribiyon ko khilane ke liye jaldi qurbani kar liya.'\n\nRasoolullah (sallAllahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: **'Toh apni qurbani phir se kare (yaani doosri qurbani qurbaan kare).'**\n\nUnhon ne kaha: 'Aey Allah ke Rasool, mere paas ek chhoti bakri hai jo abhi doodh pila rahi hai, aur yeh do bakriyon ke gosht se behtar hai. Kya main use qurbaan kar sakta hoon?'\n\nFarmaya: **'Haan, aur yeh tumhari dono qurbaniyon se behtar hai. Aur tumhare baad kisi ke liye bhi ek *jadha'ah* (chhota janwar) kaafi nahi hoga.'**\n\n---\n\n**Abu 'Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne farmaya:** Is bab (chapter) mein Jabir, Jundab, Anas, 'Uwaymir ibn Ashqar, Ibn 'Umar, aur Abu Zayd al-Ansari (razAllahu 'anhum) ki riwayatein bhi hain.\n\n**Abu 'Isa ne farmaya:** Yeh *hasan sahih* hadith hai.\n\nAhl-e-ilm ka amal yeh hai ke shahr mein koi bhi imam ke namaz ada karne se pehle qurbani (udhiyah) na kare. Lekin aik guruh ulama ne gaon ke logon ko fajr ke baad qurbani karne ki rukhsaat di, aur yeh Ibn al-Mubarak (rahmatullah 'alayhi) ka qaul hai.\n\n**Abu 'Isa ne farmaya:** Ulama ne ijma' kiya hai ke bakriyon (*al-ma'z*) mein se *jadha'ah* kaafi nahi hai," aur unhone bataya ke *jadha'ah* sirf bhaizon (*al-da'n*) mein se kaafi hota hai."""
1541,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Qasam mat khao.\"""""
1542,"Hazrat Umar (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh myn nay arz kya: \ya rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm)! myn nay jalyt kay zmanay myn byt allh alhram myn ayk rat aatykaf ky nzr ky thy۔ aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \""apny nzr pwry krw۔\"""""
1543,"Salim bin Abdullah ne apne walid (Abdullah bin Umar) se riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) aksar is qasam ko khaate the: \Nahi! Dil badalne wale ki qasam!\"""""
1544,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmaate suna: \Jo shakhs koi momin ghulaam ko azaad karega...\"""""
1545,Hazrat Suwaid bin Muqarrin Al-Muzani (Razi Allah unho) ne bayan farmaya:\n\n\Hum saat bhaa'iyon mein se sirf ek hi naukar tha," aur hum sab ke liye woh ek hi naukar tha.\"""""
1546,"Thabit bin Adh-Dahhak (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \jw shkhs aslam kay alawh ksy awr mzhb ky qsm khayay awr wh jhwta hw\"""""
1547,"Uqbah bin 'Amir (رضي الله عنه) ne bayān kiya ki unho ne kaha: \Yā Rasūlallāh (صلی الله علیہ وسلم)! Merī nekāz ne mannat ki hai ki wāda kiyā hai ke woh khālī pāon aur bā-ghayr-e-Khimār (without head-covering) Baytullāh tālāga kare.\"" Nabī (صلی الله علیہ"""
